, Commonwealth of Australia</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>National Public Health Partnership Health Promotion Task Group for Oral health</collab></person-group><source>National Health promotion Report for Oral Health.</source><year>2000</year><publisher-name>Adelaide, SA Department of Human Services</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>AHMAC Steering Committee for National Planning for Oral Health</collab></person-group><source>Oral health of Australians: National planning for oral health improvement.</source><year>2001</year><publisher-name>Adelaide, SA Department of Human Services on behalf of the Australian Health Ministers' Conference</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B25"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>National Advisory Committee on Oral Health</collab></person-group><source>Healthy mouths health lives: Australia&#x02019;s National Oral Health Plan 2004 - 2013</source><year>2004</year><publisher-name>, South Australian Department of Health</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B26"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kelman</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Fluoridation - the Israel experience</article-title><source>Community Dent Health</source><year>1996</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>42</fpage><lpage>46</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8897750</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B27"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wright</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>Bates</surname><given-names>MN</given-names></name><name><surname>Cutress</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><collab>et al</collab></person-group><source>The cost-effectiveness of f